  "description": "Subscriber Selected Stocks, Ranked From WORST to FIRST 🥇",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to a<strong> 🔒 subscriber-only episode🔒 </strong></em>of Mid-Week Movers! <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocks-are-breaking-out-again-3-names\">On the last episode</a>, <strong>Ubiquiti and Alibaba</strong> were the top 2 winners. UI is currently up <strong>+9%</strong> and Alibaba is up a <strong>whopping +22.4%</strong>...both of these we currently hold. You can always see what I am holding, and their performance anytime at the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">Stocktok Summary</a> page. You can also see my stock picking process in the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocks-are-breaking-out-again-3-names\">last Mid-Week Mover episode</a>.</p><h4><strong>Also, please note: I added to one of our winning stocks. You can view that in <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/a27b2288-ae6c-4cb6-833a-bfb84d676813\">“Quick Notes” here</a>!</strong></h4><p>Unfortunately, I am still recovering from a deadly case of Man-Flu, and my voice is shot 🪦. So this week, we will just quickly run through the subscriber picked stocks, ranking them from worst to 1st, down below! ⬇️  </p>",
